  "2026-07-06T23:50:40.432Z",codex-agent,"Duplicate check: searched all statuses for context eval corpus/golden workspace/continuity judgments; only pm-atfm and closed search-eval work matched."
  "2026-07-09T19:10:24.967Z",codex-root-20260709,"Progress evidence: committed four-scenario corpus covers tiny scratch, real-shaped hierarchy, 100-item synthetic scale, and returning-agent continuity with explicit judgments, budgets, and rationales; accepted baseline is versioned."
  "2026-07-09T19:50:42.298Z",codex-root-20260709,"Verification: committed four-scenario corpus is stable through isolated SDK-backed trackers; tiny, real-shaped, synthetic scale, and returning-agent continuity scenarios all score 1.0 for NDCG, reciprocal rank, recall, continuity, and token adherence. Scale packet is 695 estimated tokens."
  "2026-07-09T23:53:30.023Z",codex-root-20260709,"Handoff after PR #487: the initial deterministic corpus and gate are merged and green. Item remains in_progress because its required representative 10k/100k corpus expansion and threshold calibration remain future work."
  "2026-07-31T00:18:13.858Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check and incident evidence: all-status search found this existing canonical corpus task plus parent pm-atfm and closed usage-feedback implementation pm-uwfs. PR #834 CI run 30592851802 failed the context gate on Linux and Windows after the fixed 2026-07-01 served/touched timestamps aged outside the usage-signal retention window; no new item was created."
  "2026-07-31T00:19:44.634Z","harness:codex","Fix evidence: the usage-feedback scenario now derives a single current touch instant and records serving exactly one minute earlier, preserving causal ordering while preventing retention expiry. Focused runner tests pass 5/5; the full required context-quality chain restores 1.0 nDCG/MRR/recall/continuity/token adherence and passes retrieval negative control, retrieval baseline, and all 91 token surfaces."
